@* Shared bottom-center Toast (La Fiore Karabağ 2. Etap Vaziyet Planı/
   Concept/Gallery phase, 2026-08-09) — one instance per page, same shape as
   _MediaViewer.cshtml: markup-only, entirely data-driven from whichever
   [data-toast-trigger] was clicked (see site.js), so it carries no @model.
   Non-modal status message (role="status", aria-live="polite") — no
   focus-trap, no Esc/backdrop-close, unlike the Media Viewer's dialog. Sits
   inert on every page unless a trigger exists (today only
   _ProjectCatalogue.cshtml's button when Model.CatalogueComingSoon is
   true). *@

<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden data-toast role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="toast-message" data-toast-message></p>
</div>
